<section id="10033_S0007" variety="S0007">
<name>CAN Communication</name>
<ttl id="10033_S0007_741KB_T000K" variety="T000K">
<name>CAN Communication System</name>
<para id="RM000001LBY008X" category="J" type-id="801GK" name-id="950V2-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>CAN Gateway ECU Communication Stop Mode</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000001LBY008X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00000E300000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.83in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.83in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Suspected Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>CAN Gateway ECU Communication Stop Mode</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>"CAN Gateway" and ECUs connected to V bus No.2 are not displayed on the TaSCAN "CAN Bus Connected ECU Check" screen (malfunction in the CAN gateway ECU main bus side branch wire)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Network gateway computer (CAN gateway ECU) branch wire open circuit or connector malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Network gateway computer (CAN gateway ECU) power supply circuit malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Network gateway computer (CAN gateway ECU) internal malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001LBY008X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00000E400000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B162440J01" width="7.106578999in" height="5.787629434in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001LBY008X_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001LBY008X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000001LBY008X_04_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___00000E600000">
<testtitle>CAN Bus Open Circuit Inspection (CAN Gateway Branch Line)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the ignition OFF and disconnect the vehicle harness connector of the network gateway computer (CAN gateway ECU).</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the network gateway computer (CAN gateway ECU) vehicle harness connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C147891J07" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.93in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.07in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>15(CA1L) - 16(CA1H)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>54 to 69Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001LBY008X_04_0001" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000001LBY008X_04_0005" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001LBY008X_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00000E500000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness (ECU Power Source System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance and voltage between each terminal of the network gateway computer (CAN gateway ECU) vehicle harness connector and body ground.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C147891J08" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.92in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.09in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>4 (GND) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<table>
<title>Voltage</title>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.90in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.10in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>9 (IG2) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>11 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10 (IG1) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>11 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001LBY008X_04_0003" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000001LBY008X_04_0002" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001LBY008X_04_0003">
<testtitle>Replace network gateway computer<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002RWT004X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001LBY008X_04_0005">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Branch Wire or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001LBY008X_04_0002">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
